# Sample requests for the API (VS Code REST Client, Rider or Visual Studio). Start it with
# `dotnet run` in server/ first. All endpoints are in Program.cs.
@server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5095

### Who the server thinks you are ("guest" unless a proxy sets the identity header)
GET {{server_HostAddress}}/api/me

### Sidebar: every lesson and exercise with your progress
GET {{server_HostAddress}}/api/lessons

### One graded exercise
GET {{server_HostAddress}}/api/lessons/hashmap-two-sum

### One tool lesson
GET {{server_HostAddress}}/api/tools/big-o-notation

### Due for review
GET {{server_HostAddress}}/api/review

### Your progress rows
GET {{server_HostAddress}}/api/progress

### Grade C# on the server (the fallback grader); records progress like the UI does
POST {{server_HostAddress}}/api/execute/csharp
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lessonId": "hashmap-two-sum", "code": "// paste a solution here" }
